<BaseLayout breadcrumbLabel="CNC automation" title="CNC automation systems for tool & mould makers | PCam" description="PCam CNC automation combines robotic handling, cell control, pallets, tools and mixed machine integration for unattended production.">
<SolutionDetail eyebrow="CNC automation" title="Unattended production is a system problem." lead="Automate the flow around CNC machines—not just the loading motion. PCam combines handling, job execution, identification and production data for high-mix manufacturing." problem="A robot can load a machine. It cannot decide whether the next job is actually executable." approach="Reliable unattended production depends on the complete state of the job: the correct NC program, zero point, workpiece, pallet, tools, machine availability, process routing and downstream inspection. The automation layer has to understand those dependencies before it moves anything." bullets={['Pallet, electrode and tool handling','Multi-machine routing and cell control','DMC / RFID identification','Machine interfaces across mixed CNC environments','Integrated wash, dry and measuring stations','Layouts from compact cells to linear and gantry systems']} productSlugs={['pcamcube','pcamrobocube','pcamfmc','pcamfmc2','pcamlinear','pcamgantry','pcamheavy','pcamcobot','pcamagv','pcamcell','pcamjobmanager']} architecture={[{title:'Orders & priorities',text:'What needs to be produced and when'},{title:'Cell orchestration',text:'Executable jobs, routing and resources'},{title:'Robot & logistics',text:'Pallets, tools and physical movement'},{title:'CNC / CMM',text:'Machining, EDM and inspection'}]} seoTitle="CNC automation" />
</BaseLayout>
